/*
📘 readCursors Usage:

- readCursors tracks the last-read timestamp for each participant.
- Update it when the user opens the chat or scrolls to view messages.
- A message is unread if: message.createdAt > readCursors[userId]
- If readCursors[userId] is not yet set, treat all messages as unread.
- Set initial readCursor to conversation.createdAt or null.
- After updating readCursor, recalculate unreadCounts for the other user.

🔍 Example to check if a message is unread:
if (!conversation.readCursors[receiverId] || message.createdAt > conversation.readCursors[receiverId]) {
  // 🔴 Still unread
} else {
  // ✅ Already read
}
